# text_id = 1598
# text = My purpose in rising is merely to reserve the position of my hon . and right hon . Friends by saying that we think his explanations on both these questions , but particularly on the Malayan question , wholly unsatisfactory , and that we shall certainly raise these matters again at the earliest possible opportunity in the next Session .
