# text_id = 1619
# text = It would , therefore , be a singularly fruitless waste of time for this House to discuss in Committee Amendments which ex hypothesi could not be adopted consistently with the desire of the House , already so clearly expressed on two occasions , that this Bill , if need be , should be passed under the provisions of the Parliament Act .
