# text_id = 1640
# text = The tragic story is told , I think , in Chapter VI of the Scott Report , and it culminates with the reductio ad absurdum that in order to obtain some degree of control of planning , local authorities up to date had evolved plats for housing a population of no less than 300,000,000 more than our present population of 41,000,000 .
