# text_id = 1644
# text = It will , of course , be necessary , in an appropriate form , to obtain the authority of the House of Commons ( this is a Motion affecting money ) but I can assure your Lordships that I do not anticipate that there will be any undue delay if the Motion is approved in this House this afternoon .
