# text = When the Government consider , in conjunction with U.N.R.R.A. , the feeding of Europe , would it be too much to ask them to remember that 110,000,000 Indians live permanently between starvation point and serious malnutrition , and , in addition , another 100,000,000 Indians get just enough to eat but not enough to give them protection from disease ?
