# text = The purpose of this co-ordination is to make the most efficient use of fuel and power , and , to me , it seems quite impossible to utilise our fuel resources to the best possible extent , and to the advantage of this country , unless all the industries that consume fuel for the purpose of pro-clueing power are co-ordinated .
