# text_id = 1718
# text = It is extraordinarily difficult to obtain sites in the City , because the ground landlords naturally are very anxious that there shall be no delays when it is possible to start permanent buildings ; they feel that if there is a temporary structure on the land , a considerable time might elapse before they can get possession to build .
