# text_id = 1742
# text = On the industrial side , there might of course be a tendency to overdo the setting up of new industries , which could not be continued later under peace - time conditions , and which might tend to become white elephants ; but the difficulty of importing machinery from abroad at the present time is a safeguard against this danger .
