# text_id = 1763
# text = Little is said in detail about the suggestion that this new Ministry of Social Security is to take over all the employment exchanges , nor about the inevitable elimination of private organisations which at the moment supply labour , but the idea is , I understand , that everybody would have a green card and go to an employment exchange .
