# text_id = 1765
# text = Everything has been done backwards , at least that is how it looks to me , and I hope that in due course the Solicitor - General , or the Attorney - General , or the Parliamentary Secretary to the Ministry of War Transport , will assure us that , after having read the Bill , he really understands it .
