# text_id = 1777
# text = One of my oldest co-governors , one of the founders of Roehampton , conceived the idea of bringing the blessings of Roehampton to all our Allies , and , to - day , representatives of many of our Allies have come to Roehampton to learn our methods with the object of passing them on to their own countries after the war .
