# text = I have said on previous occasions that there is little fault to find with the administration of the Ministry of Pensions , but there is a great deal of fault to find with the lack of humanity and intelligence in the administration of the Royal Hospital , Chelsea , particularly when it is compared with the Ministry of Pensions administration .
