# text = When once things return to normal , are we going to have relays of policemen pursuing agitated females and chasing them away from streets when they stop for a minute or two outside a shop ; or are we going to provide the motor world with some proper accommodation , perhaps on lines suggested by the noble Lord , Lord Sempill ?
