# text_id = 1822
# text = Bearing all that in mind , and bearing in mind the pledge given by the Attorney - General that he would see if a halfway house to our previous proposal could be found , I move this Amendment as that halfway house and as a means of bringing in the manufacturers during the framing of the regulations , and not at a later stage when the damage might have been done .
