# text_id = 1827
# text = I implore the right hon . and learned Gentleman to think again , not merely because I am opposed to experiments in Socialism , but because I do not think that even he , with his political prejudice , if he was well aware of what he was doing , would seek radically to alter the law of Scotland by the interpolation of this Amendment which includes these rather dangerous words .
