# text_id = 1832
# text = I am not concerned to criticise Congress Governments , but the policy of the Congress High Command , which at the end of 1939 ordered out the Ministers , stopped such good work as they were doing and compelled the Provincial Governors to take over direct control under Section 93 of the Government of India Act , for the further continuance of which provision is made in the present Bill .
