# text_id = 1833
# text = The Parliamentary Secretary said that as the function of training was the principal function — I think that was what he said — that was a matter for the Council as a whole and that it would be wrong to lay down any method by which they should do it , and that as finance was a relatively subsidiary matter it would be dealt with by a statutory committee .
