# text = On the one hand , they enable household waste and scrap to be used which would otherwise be wasted , and in the second place , if they develop as much as I hope they will , they will go some way at all events towards making good the inevitable reduction in the pig population which otherwise would have to occur owing to the shortage of imported feeding - stuffs .
