# text_id = 1837
# text = Mr. Tinker asked the Secretary for Mines whether he is aware that many miners have to travel long distances to the colliery from their homes ; that this means a reduced wage because of the fares they have to pay ; and , seeing munition workers are granted a remittance of travelling expenses , will he examine the position and try and get the miners on a similar basis ?
