# text = The reason of these distinctions is that , in the nature of things , although they have improved their position and although they now number among them many distinguished Indians , upon the whole their educational , social and economic standards are lower than the standards of the caste Hindus , and on that account it has always been regarded as essential that they should have their own distinctive representation .
