# text = But , my Lords , the melancholy fact is this — I do not seek to conceal it — that in all these 48,500 divorce cases brought by serving men and women , not more than 5,198 decrees nisi had been obtained by the end of 1945 , and of these 5,000 , some 3,000 were not then finally finished on account of questions of custody or costs or something .
