# text = While thanking my hon . Friend for his reply , and for the new arrangements which he has introduced , might I ask whether he will take special steps to follow up the working of these new arrangements , and to make sure that they do in fact relieve the very real hardships which have been caused already to quite a number of people by the quite inadequate arrangements ?
