# text = I feel , however , in spite of the satisfactory statement made by the Minister , who has given us to understand — almost the assurance — that the City will remain a separate constituency , that someone should point out that the claim of the City to two Members is not so wholly fantastic or extravagant as it has been represented to be in the opening speeches to - day .
