# text_id = 1843
# text = It would be out of Order for me to suggest that new legislation ought to be introduced to make premiums illegal , even if it were practicable to do it , and I realise that there are very acute difficulties in devising any legislation which would prevent this practice taking place between a person who feels he must pay a premium in order to get accommodation , and a landlord .
