# text_id = 1847
# text = We are now faced with the position , because of that change in method of production , that there are not now the women available , and highly skilled men are forced to do these jobs which could be performed by women , whilst more serious jobs concerning the production of plant , etc. , which could be done by men stand idle because the men are not available .
