# text = In spite of that , and in spite of the fact that I am the first Home Secretary who has ever managed to get a grant out of the Treasury for this purpose , and have got them 25 per cent . , I am afraid that some of these eulogies are not quite as vigorously expressed today as they were when the grant was only in very doubtful prospect .
