# text = I ask the Minister , with his great powers of control over local education authorities , which the Education Act , 1944 , has given him , to exercise that influence and control so that as far as possible the age of 11 or 11 plus and not the age of 10 years 6 months shall , in the case of education authorities generally , be the normal age of transfer .
