# text_id = 1856
# text = And the view the Government deliberately formed — because I am not improvising on this matter ; it is naturally one of those fundamental things which was gone into at an early stage and has been considered since — was that the War Damage Commission should be a body which is created and staffed with a view to dealing with compensation , which brings in the use of valuers .
