# text_id = 1858
# text = After giving the matter that careful consideration , we came to the conclusion that it was impracticable and undesirable to take that course , and I hope I shall be able to carry the hon . Member and the House with me in concluding that we were right in that view and that the present provisions of the Bill meet the position which the hon . Member has in mind .
