# text_id = 1860
# text = To - day there are many blind persons whose sense of touch has been so developed , perhaps as a result of their blindness who , after training , have been able to take inspection jobs requiring great delicacy of touch , and they are doing jobs in our engineering shops not only with credit to themselves but with great advantage to the people for whom they are working .
