# text_id = 1861
# text = Knowing them as I do , living as I do amongst them on every possible occasion — preferring to be with them than with the type of person represented on the other side of the Committee — I know they are concerned , very concerned , as to why we have not used the whole of the resources of the community to get us out of this economic difficulty .
