# text_id = 1862
# text = It is not pleasant for anyone to ask the Government to refuse to respond to the appeal that has been made , and yet it is because I am deeply convinced that the blockade , and the blockade maintained in its full rigour , is essential for bringing the war to an end at the earliest possible moment that I appeal to my hon . Friend to stand absolutely firm .
