# text_id = 1863
# text = Is it not a fact that the whole risk , both in regard , to capital expenditure and as to management , lies on the Government ; and is the Parliamentary Secretary aware that the Chancellor of the Exchequer gave one reply on 2nd February and he himself gave four different replies this year and towards the end of last year , and that none of them are consistent ?
