# text = In relation to the point made by the hon . Member for East Fife and by my hon . and gallant Friend the Member for Orkney and Shetland ( Sir B. Neven - Spence ) , I cannot too strongly emphasise how necessary it is , with regard to determining those who are to receive assistance under this Bill , that all possible local assistance and advice should be secured .
