# text_id = 1865
# text = The second point arises with regard to high treason , and it also arises with regard to an overlapping offence which might be committed by a British subject in Germany , namely an offence under Defence Regulation 2A , which applies to acts likely to assist the enemy and done with intent to assist the enemy , which applies to British subjects in foreign countries as well as to people here .
