# text_id = 1867
# text = That may be good enough for Africans — I do not know , for Africans seem to me as competent to manage the affairs of their own country as we are to manage ours — but it does not seem the right policy for the Newfoundlanders , who , as far as I have had contact with them , strike me as a very fine and intelligent body of people .
