# text_id = 1868
# text = Earlier in the day we were discussing the procedure and the machinery of the House of Commons , and I think it is a tribute to our procedure and our machinery that we can hold a Debate on the small trader , and the small shopkeeper , which I think is the third Debate of its kind in a few months , and can voice his grievances in this manner .
