# text_id = 1869
# text = I am quite aware of the difficulties of the banks and I am not making any attack on them , but I think the Treasury — and here I address myself particularly to my noble and learned friend the Lord Chancellor — have a responsibility in this matter and ought to bring their machinery into action to see whether something cannot be done to help some of these deserving people .
