# text_id = 1872
# text = It seems to me obvious that , in making any approach to our Empire and to our Allies about the future of civil aviation , we should make that approach to include aviation in general both for peace and war and so avoid the mistake that was made after the last war , when we formed the League of Nations and gave it no striking power to implement its decisions .
