# text_id = 1875
# text = In the same way , if in Germany these telephones , telegraphs , airways and railways services were run by private companies or by the Governments of the United Nations , Germany would have very good systems and nothing to complain about , and it would be a way of getting a grip on Germany by means of which no other war such as this would ever start again .
