# text_id = 1876
# text = As I have said , by all the canons of prudence and common sense the wise thing to do when this danger threatened , it seems to me , would have been not to relieve her by another ship sent up to run the gauntlet of these batteries but to send her down from a place where she could be no possible use , and to rely on aeroplanes .
