# text_id = 1883
# text = If the Home Secretary or the Undersecretary can convince me that a unit of 100,000 is better than 60,000 then I am willing to be convinced , but I am not at all impressed that we ought to pass it , because to my commonsense and practical mind it appears to be probable that there is some relation between the number of " coppers " and the size of the population .
