# text_id = 1886
# text = Although the Minister of State gave a somewhat lukewarm assurance yesterday at Question time about the withdrawal of Soviet occupational forces , I must confess that I myself would feel happier about that withdrawal if I were quite certain that a number of technicians had not been left behind and were today wearing uniforms of a rather different colour from those which they wore at this time last year .
