# text = I did think at one time that , apart from the constitutional aspects of this matter , this Amendment might have had something in its favour , on the merits ; but I confess that any such delusion has been dissipated by the speeches of the hon . Member for Mid-Bedford ( Mr. Lennox - Boyd ) and the hon . and gallant Member for Central Glasgow ( Colonel Hutchison ) .
