# text_id = 1888
# text = If the Government feel bound to impose summer time and double summer time , it is up to them now , having done so , to pay far more attention to the needs of food producers , to give them more coal in the country areas , to give them more machinery , more feeding stuffs and more labour , and to give them as little summer time as possible .
