# text_id = 1889
# text = In addition , grants and loans are available , under the Herring Industry Act , 1944 , for the construction or purchase of boats to be used mainly for the herring fishing , and £ 110,000 by way of grant and £ 198,000 by way of loan have already been offered , and accepted , in respect of 41 new boats , 19 ex-Admiralty boats and 12 second - hand boats .
