# text_id = 1891
# text = Whether it is exercised by a Minister with a Department of his own or by a Minister sitting as Chairman of a Cabinet Sub - Committee is a matter of detail as compared with the importance of the point made by the noble Lord , Lord Addison , that he should be a Minister of real weight in the Cabinet capable of putting plans and policy through once policy is evolved .
