# text_id = 1892
# text = If we could return to the traditional simple pipes and fifes and drum bands in our county regiments I believe we should help to maintain , in that way more than in any other way , the magnificent fighting spirit and morale of our Armies , for our soldiers greatly appreciate music , and particularly the music of their own bands when they come out to the front line .
