# text_id = 1898
# text = Whereas the economy of the Eastern hemisphere is in decline , while that of the Western hemisphere — not because of capitalism , but because of immunity from war and because of the bounty of nature and the facts of geography — is in the ascendant , obviously there is a general demand for Western currency — which , indeed , was why we had the breakdown of convertibility last summer .
