# text_id = 1901
# text = Above all , and in the first place , in all that we undertake , whether as an individual power or with the United Nations organisation , or in respect of Western Union , we must devote ourselves in all these matters to the preservation of as much as is left to us of the former British Empire or Commonwealth of Nations comprised within the circle of the British Crown .
