# text = The Minister is saying that he will be able to call upon people for Civil Defence just as the war Ministries are calling upon people for fighting purposes , but in the same way that the Services have laid down machinery by which citizens who object on conscientious grounds may make application not to participate , so the Minister can quite well say that he is prepared to recognise some exceptions .
