# text = In the course of those examinations , they became convinced , as is stated in paragraph 152 of the White Paper , that the appointment of a Minister and the transference of existing powers in this field to him , would ease the transition period between the old scheme and the coming in of the new , and would enable the new scheme to be brought more quickly into legislative form .
