# text_id = 1907
# text = I can understand the Government taking the view that a paltry 5s . to parents , irrespective of whether they wanted it or not , was hardly the way to deal with this matter , that 5s . was of little help in thousands of homes where it was not needed and that under no circumstances could it be said to be compensation for the loss of a son .
