# text_id = 1908
# text = I am very glad to find that , as I understand the position , the Government , in spite of a certain tendency towards controls , take the same view of this matter , because the right hon . Gentleman has just said that he hopes the duration of the Bill will be no more than appears on its face and will not operate beyond 31st December , 1947 .
