# text_id = 1910
# text = Another item which should be excluded , so as to escape the effect of Purchase Tax , is lambskin , and I should like to ask what is the intention of the Financial Secretary in that direction , because again it is a very useful item on the asset side of the balance sheet when the expenditure side shows to a farmer the loss of a lamb which has died prematurely .
