# text_id = 1911
# text = Although there is some question whether we might have delayed the building of this shelter a bit longer , and thereby saved money , if we had known about it — a lot of boroughs would have done that — there is no doubt that the existence of that deep shelter saved thousands of lives in those weeks when there were such heavy raids over London , and particularly over Southwark .
