# text = The Minister of Education resisted the Amendment in this House and he resisted it mainly on the ground that , if he were going to consult one of his colleagues , having regard to the immense scope of the Bill , he would haves , in one way or another , to consult most of his colleagues about various matters that would arise in pursuance of the Education Bill .
