# text_id = 1915
# text = Under this Bill huge white concrete dams will be erected , the rivers and waterfalls downstream of the dams will virtually disappear , while in summer , when the glens are most visited , wide stretches of rotting vegetation and slimy mud will be exposed above the dams , with here and there the blackened skeletons of trees , submerged for half the year , projecting above the ooze .
