# text_id = 1919
# text = The Government are perfectly prepared , if it be the desire of the House , and on the condition that this Bill should be passed as a matter of urgency arising out of the necessities of the war , to agree to the examination by a Select Committee of these archaic rules and how far it may be necessary to tighten them up in one direction or relax them in another .
