# text_id = 1920
# text = As we see it at the moment , if a tenant were to put in a new boiler , radiators , and so on , in order to replace an out - of - date hot water system , it would not be possible under the Measure for the assignor to say that those improvements were in any way structural alterations because they were , in fact , replacements .
