# text = Composite companies are exempted , but if any other company , not what is technically called a composite company here , comes within the 75 per cent . category , then all the assets of that company , although they have nothing whatever to do with the purpose of this Bill , which deals with the generation and distribution of electricity in the United Kingdom , must be taken over .
