# text = The committees which will be given the task of considering applications for permission to come within the scheme will have laid before them some very weird and wonderful situations and if from time to time in the proper exercise of their discretion they can discourage some types of people from going to law , they will be doing a very good turn for the Judges and for the legal profession generally .
