# text = The hon . Member for Wimbledon said that in the electricity industry all unions had been consulted by the Minister , but because the Minister has done that are Members now to say that they will leave this power in the hands of the Minister , that it should be at the discretion of the Minister as to which organisations he will now consult in relation to the Gas Industry ?
