# text_id = 1929
# text = I appeal to the Government to reconsider the suggestion that the value payment should be made at a date which may have no relation at all to the cost of replacement , and to consider also the desirability of responding to the widespread desire to reconsider the relationship between the tenant landlord and the mortgagee on the one hand and the tenant landlord and the ground landlord on the other .
