# text_id = 1930
# text = As to the , poorer authorities such as those referred to so eloquently by my hon . and learned Friend the Member for Montgomery , I hope the Minister will frame the regulations in such a way as to permit of dealing with such authorities in a more generous way than is needed by other districts whose needs will in fact be equitably met under the general arrangements ulimately decided upon .
