# text = As I realize that Parliament is the ultimate arbiter in all these things , and that if anything of that kind took place it would mean that the Government of the day would have to bring in a further amending Bill , I have decided , having considered the matter very fully and in view of the difficulties mentioned by the Secretary of State , not to move my Amendment .
