# text = Having given them that right , there is the inevitable result that there may not be enough Trinitarian trigonometrists , or there are not enough Catholics with a knowledge of calculus , and therefore , inevitably the governors of the aided school have to go outside the denomination , and accept , instead of a Catholic to teach calculus , an Anglican , and they put him on the staff .
