# text = I have tried to do something in this respect in previous years , and in another office , and I am immensely relieved to know that at this moment the Ministry of Agriculture have taken over from the Ministry of Labour the scheme , originally designed only for boys from Special Areas , and that it now applies to boys from whatever part of the country they may come .
