# text_id = 1951
# text = The young man about whom I am speaking was going home , but he was using two gallons of petrol which he was not entitled to take and which he ought to have been punished for taking , but not punished in this way — 36 days under close arrest awaiting trial , three months in detention barracks , reduced to the ranks , with the stoppage of pay involved .
