# text_id = 1952
# text = I have been back in this House for two and a half years and I cannot pretend to be up to date on this subject , but I have spoken to a great many officers , and I hope the First Lord will realise that the views I have put were not my own but those of a great many officers who are proud to serve under his leadership .
