# text_id = 1956
# text = I am not speaking at all of the very difficult case of the owner - occupier — I realise that there are some tremendously important issues arising out of that class of case — but on the general relationship between mortgagors and mortgagees , I would ask hon . Gentlemen opposite who press the contrary point of view to realise the nature of the contract that is very often entered into .
