# text_id = 1959
# text = This lift , as it is called , in the incidence of Death Duties makes nonsense of the appeals of the Chancellor for the production drive , because the urge which impels a man forward to increased efforts is the urge to save for his children and to see that they have at least as good a start in life as he had , and preferably a better one .
