# text = The Members of this House feel that the suggestion made by the Chair and by the Government for an organized time - table is a reasonable thing , and I expect the majority of my hon . Friends would say that , if we cannot make more rapid progress than has been made up to now , they would support the Government in seeing that a more rapid procedure is adopted .
