# text_id = 1961
# text = No local authority can venture to embark upon an ambitious planning scheme unless it knows what will be the financial effort upon its ratepayers , and everyone is aware that the main reason why the previous Planning Acts have failed to achieve their purpose — as they have failed in the main , although much has been done under them — has been the uncertainty with regard to compensation and betterment .
