# text = My hon . Friend the Parliamentary Secretary to the Ministry of Transport knows as well as I do that during the time of the 1945 Election , when we had conversations with those concerned with exports in Cardiff and elsewhere in South Wales , it was not contemplated that it would be possible to export any coal at all from Wales within five years after the end of the war .
