# text_id = 1968
# text = What this Bill deals with is the co-ordination of the nervous system of the whole Commonwealth , of its system of communication not only within itself , but with the rest of the world — a complex network of cables and wireless links which binds together the countries of the Commonwealth in all the continents , and at the same time provides them with essential communications with many foreign countries .
