# text_id = 1970
# text = I should like to know whether or not this is an indication that , in view of the fact that the partition decision has now been shelved and , in effect , destroyed , in view of the fact that the Foreign Secretary has won a brilliant diplomatic triumph at Lake Success , there is to be a change of British policy in respect of Palestine after 15th May ?
