# text_id = 1974
# text = What we are concerned with is the whole conduct of the war and those conducting the war , and the House of Commons is the proper place for that to be discussed , and I suggest that if the matter is to be put off , we should have a definite undertaking that there will be a discussion , at least not later than the First Sitting Day of next week .
