# text_id = 1976
# text = When he thinks about this again , I hope he will bear in mind the fact that the ratepayers will want to look at the whole of one particular local area of that kind ; they will not be able to take one particular area , then another particular area , and then a third particular area at different times ; there will be an overall method of assessing this matter .
