# text_id = 1977
# text = It might be found , in the case of civil aviation , as in the case of railways and in the case of British shipping , that that Department should be the Ministry of Transport One can well imagine that an important branch of the Ministry of Transport might perform any of the functions of the present Ministry of Civil Aviation , so far as it is necessary to continue them .
