# text_id = 1978
# text = I must tell your Lordships , as indeed I am glad to do , that the initiative in this matter came from the Law Society , who themselves offered to set up a special Services Divorce Department if the three Service Departments would form an organization to help the troops by giving legal advice at first hand , and if special procedure adapted to Service requirements could be introduced .
