# text_id = 1979
# text = Bearing in mind that an attempt to commit the offence may be in some cases , and often is , as brutal as other offences with violence which carry much heavier penalties , the House will find no difficulty in agreeing that a maximum penalty of seven years cannot be unduly high for the worse type of offence and that a maximum of two years is certainly unduly low .
