# text_id = 1982
# text = Mr. Frankel asked the Minister of Health whether any steps can be taken to provide that where a son or daughter serving in the Forces makes a voluntary allotment to a parent , such allotment shall be disregarded in considering any application for public assistance , especially in view of the fact that in most cases at least part of the allotment is spent upon the son or daughter ?
