# text_id = 1984
# text = In the second place , as speed is the essence of dealing with our problem , if a director has to make an urgent decision in connection with a particular matter with which he is associated , and a mistake is made in circumstances that he could not envisage owing to the necessity for quick decisions , he shall not be held responsible , but the responsibility shall rest upon me .
