# text_id = 1987
# text = It is much better , in the public interest , that , as far as possible , the details of the intentions of Parliament should be stated on the face of a Statute and that it should not be necessary for those who have to deal with Statutes to refer to Regulations which may , in some cases , be amended subsequently either by another Statute or by amending Regulations .
