# text_id = 1988
# text = On 17th July a further definition was put into the Regulation defining securities as including life assurance or endowment policies because , between May and July , there had been the over - running of the Low Countries and France and it was necessary to make sure , as far as we could , that there would be no leakage by which moneys would be improperly transferred outside the sterling area .
