# text_id = 1990
# text = As we are constantly reminded in this House and in the Press , there is an appalling death - rate from road accidents , and , in my opinion , much of this has been due to traffic which ought never to have been on our roads , which was a danger to life and limb , and which could very well have been carried on some other means of transport .
