# text_id = 1991
# text = As far as my knowledge goes , those are the only two recognised organisations of physiotherapists , but if there is still a doubt in the mind of the hon . Member for Kilmarnock ( Mr. Ross ) , he would be reassured if he could get into touch with the Ministry of Health which has formed recently a consultative committee for the practice of this side of medical work .
