# text = Since the Prime Minister made his intervention to - day , I have had more than one contact with representative neutrals in London , who feel that if this matter were to be judged upon the basis of putting personal friendship and personalities before the question of really winning the war , we should do a great deal to alienate the sympathy that remains with us in neutral spheres .
