# text_id = 1995
# text = Indeed , when listening to the Debates during the protracted proceedings on the Criminal Justice Bill , I could not help thinking that if the employment officer fits the young men and women who come under his purview into the best possible jobs , far fewer of our people will ever have to be dealt with under the Criminal Justice Bill — which , surely , is what we all hope .
