# text = In any case , " — this is where we come to a heading , " Denationalisation " — the first one — " In any case we should restore a wide measure of freedom to Road Transport , " A " and " B " Licences , to the Liverpool Cotton Market ( which should be re-opened as the rubber market has been ) and certain parts of Civil Aviation .
