# text_id = 2000
# text = The result of the proposals put out .at Interlaken the other day would be , for example , the raising of the problem of our existing treaty obligations to foreign countries , for if we are to surrender part of our sovereign rights to an international body , in the manner proposed , we shall no longer be able to fulfil some of them , but shall have to cancel them .
