# text_id = 2001
# text = Although I am as pleased as anyone can be with the concessions that have been made , and appreciate those concessions , I am afraid that the general impression that was given to the country was that almost automatically allowances would be paid to a great number of families which are not receiving them at the present time ; but I repeat that masses of people will get no allowances .
