# text_id = 2002
# text = The main effect is that , whatever happens , 1st May , 1950 , can no longer be the date of transfer , for if this Bill becomes law early next year under the new Parliament Act , we would have to rush the preliminary steps required to make 1st May the take - over date , so as seriously to jeopardise the successful launching of our scheme of public ownership .
