# text_id = 2003
# text = I was informed by the Stationery Office that it would not be possible to go on meeting demands on this scale without dislocating the normal production of the daily HANSARD and the timely publication of the bound volumes , and so I felt re- luctantly obliged to give instructions to the Stationery Office that for the time being reprints should be limited to a thousand copies of any particular speech .
