# text_id = 2004
# text = Ministers are going into the country making speeches and are telling the workers that if it were not for American assistance , we would not be able to maintain our standard of life , that we would not be able to have an adequate supply of raw materials to keep our factories going , that we would have unemployment and that our standard of life would be very much reduced .
