# text_id = 2005
# text = I would suggest , further , that the right hon . and learned Gentleman the Member for Montgomery ( Mr. C. Davies ) has made out a case , not for the exclusion of Wales , but for the exclusion of the Welsh , and I would remind him that the Welsh carry their temperament and carry their sentiments far from their borders , even into Birmingham , as the lion .
