# text_id = 2007
# text = If we had said at the time when we were sending our expedition to Norway , " After all , it is a very precarious operation and we doubt if it will come off , " that would not have been very cheering to the Norwegian Government and we should very rightly and properly have been accused of the most hopeless defeatism and of betraying our cause throughout the world .
