# text_id = 2008
# text = There was one survey made early in 1941 , which showed that 25 per cent . of the samples taken were found to be not in accordance with specification , but no measures were taken to punish those persons , and if you have a loaf whose composition is not disclosed and remains unenforced , you cannot expect success , which the Minister , I am sure , wishes to secure .
