# text_id = 2009
# text = If it is possible for the ordinary farmer to draw intelligent conclusions and to have confidence in those conclusions , why is it not possible for the Minister , with all the authority of the War Cabinet behind him , to produce his own White Paper , and to say , " Here are the conclusions we draw ; on them you can mould your industry and plan your future " ?
