# text_id = 2011
# text = I would suggest that unless we are able to make substantial progress during the next few years with the building of new towns there will be a grave danger of giving a new lease of life to the evil of overcrowding in the already congested cities and towns which it is one of the main purposes of the Bill to relieve by means of creating the proposed new towns .
