# text = Why should not the Government treat the agricultural worker — who will have to put in a very much longer day as a result of summer time — on the same basis , and give him a little more fuel , and allocate more consumer goods to the rural areas in order to give an incentive to produce the food necessary to feed the miners to get the coal ?
