# text = It has been the conception of service to the nation which has altered , and I wonder sometimes , when we are talking about the glory that comes to a man who has left his kindred and gone into the Forces of the Crown , whether we have any measure at all of the praise that ought to be given to the people who have conducted these services in the past .
