# text = So it was in the natural development of political thought that something in the nature of a measure of mediatisation , to use the word which was used by Germany , should have been adopted by the Crown Representative , that these small States in Kathiawar might be attached to the prosperous and well - governed larger neighbouring States in order that they might enjoy the same advantages as the State .
