# text_id = 2018
# text = I would refer my hon . and gallant Friend to the statement made by the Prime Minister on 16th November , 1944 , in which it was made clear that during the interim period many war - time controls over raw materials , industrial capacity and so forth would continue to be necessary , and that all controls , including those over labour , were a part of an organised scheme .
