# text = As far as the poorer authorities are concerned , for this and for other purposes the Government have provided a Public Works Loans Board , which makes grants to the poorer local authorities , and they are able to get better terms than they would be able to do if they were forced into the open market , where the big , wealthy authorities can sometimes command very good terms .
