# text = As I understand it , meanwhile the present provisions of the Act are to remain because there is nothing in this Bill to put in their place , but as soon as the regulations , which are intended to be tantamount to and to replace the provisions of the 1921 Act , are made , it would be proper to repeal that Act , because it would then become superfluous .
