# text = I think that the Committee as a whole is bound to agree that , whereas , in normal circumstances where there is no shortage of raw materials , a shortage of civilian goods does not arise , there are certain shortages today which we must be prepared to accept as existing entirely as a result of the war and the fact that there are insufficient goods to go round .
