# text = I wish it to go out to the country that it is a waste of shipping to take from Wales the sort of coal that is being supplied and to send it through the Bristol Channel and right up the danger zone , when we could get the coal from England and Scotland and carry across in a short time three cargoes for every one that comes from Wales .
