# text_id = 2031
# text = I hope he will protect the consumers , and that , if need be , he will commandeer a greater quantity of strawberries , because I am not interested very much — except on that one day to which I have referred — whether I get strawberries or not ; I am interested , however , in whether we are to have an adequate and generous supply of jam next winter .
