# text = Mr. Boothby asked the Minister of War Transport whether he is aware that the existing transport facilities at Yarmouth , both by rail and road , are quite inadequate for the expeditious handling of the herring now being landed there ; and , in view of the loss of valuable food caused by this , whether he will take immediate steps to improve these facilities during the remainder of the season .
