# text_id = 2036
# text = You may search the money columns of the newspapers in vain to find any quotation of what francs are worth in sterling , and it is quite certain , of course , that the debts which are causing so much anxiety to these unfortunate people are debts in francs , deposits made in francs , and if they ought to be paid they ought to be paid in francs .
