# text = If the Motion is carried tonight , it will take from the Ministry of Labour an instrument that has been successful , that has caused no hardship upon any workers , under which there has only been one prosecution , under which the manpower of the nation has been built up in the main industries and under which we have had a substantially improved economic position in this country .
