# text_id = 2038
# text = Clause 22 is the usual financial Clause , and Clause 23 makes clear that the Parliament of Northern Ireland has power to make laws on any of the matters dealt with in the First Schedule of this Bill which fall within its jurisdiction — shop hours , for example — notwithstanding that some Defence Regulation on the subject may be in force in Northern Ireland by virtue of this Bill .
