# text = Is my right hon . Friend aware that in view of the fact the Egyptians are several hundred million pounds up on us , I gather , as the result of the war , there is a certain degree of what I might call friendly resentment felt by the Forces at the imposition of this tax on what is one of the few consolations of service in that area ?
