# text = Supposing premium for market A was 15 per cent . , for market B 8 per cent . and for market C 6 per cent . , and then perhaps there were a dozen markets tacked on which , taken by themselves , would be a 1 per cent . premium or less . If you add them together and level them out I do not think the insurer would lose .
