# text_id = 2042
# text = With regard to the major cinema circuits — the groups of 200 cinemas or more — Clause 5 ( 7 ) of this Bill will now provide a statutory basis for the implementation of the Government 's policy of preventing any further expansion of these powerful groups , subject only to the qualification that it is not the Government 's intention to give one group a permanent advantage over another .
