# text_id = 2048
# text = I want to remind the Chancellor that the effect of this will be that , before the Budget is introduced next April , every shopkeeper who thinks he has something in stock from which Purchase Tax may be removed will run that stock down in order to hold as little as possible of it , and not to be caught by the lifting of Purchase Tax from that particular article .
