# text = Apart from that reason , I was impressed by the argument of the noble Lord , Lord Morrison , during the Committee stage , to the effect that if the member in question were an honest man — and of course we hope that he will be — these Amendments would be unnecessary , whereas if he were not an honest man the Amendments would in any case be inadequate .
