# text = That is an important and valuable privilege belonging to the status and quality of a British citizen , and the fact that the Home Office have found , as they undoubtedly have found , a certain difficulty in a minority of cases where women have used this aspect of the law to obtain British citizenship does not seem to me to be a conclusive reason for altering that principle .
