# text = I will go further — and here again I believe I am adopting the view expressed by Mr. Gladstone in his speech — and say that I do agree that before a Prime Minister ever took the responsibility of appointing to the office of Lord Chancellor a Roman Catholic he undoubtedly would be acting most imprudently unless first the law on the matter was by Statute made quite clear .
