# text_id = 2057
# text = I want to suggest that the best way to deal with the situation is to treat the whole of East Africa — Uganda , Kenya and Tanganyika — as one region , one area , or whatever you like to call it ; rub out the names " Uganda , " " Tanganyika " and " Kenya " and reorganize the whole area , looking at it as one region .
