# text_id = 2060
# text = I appreciate his difficulties with staff , or rather lack of trained staff , and so on , but surely it is possible to arrange in the London Toll Exchange for somebody , not necessarily at all skilled , to be available to answer the telephone , to record the calls which are put in , and then to pass them on to the skilled operators who manipulate the machinery .
