# text = Sir Irving Albery asked the Minister of Labour if he will defer proceeding with the Reinstatement in Civil Employment Bill pending inquiries from the principal employers of labour , and the principal bodies representing employers generally , as to whether they can give guarantees on behalf of their members that all employees returning from war service will be reinstated in employment within the trades and industries which they represent .
