# text = In this Second Reading speech I shall concentrate on trying to expound the total intentions of the Government as represented both by the Bill before the House and the Draft Order , but your Lordships may of course be interested during the discussion to - day and subsequently in the precise relationship between the Bill and the Order , and naturally I shall try to satisfy any curiosity on that point .
