# text = I am glad to say , however , that the speeches of other hon . Members were not so barren in constructive advice , and if I am not able to deal with all the points raised , I can assure hon . Members that their suggestions will be scrutinised and that they will receive replies in writing on any which I am not able to deal with to - night .
