# text_id = 2070
# text = If we are to achieve the fullest production of which we are capable it is necessary to give incentives to everybody who is contributing to production , and I maintain that people in this position , provided they are working hard and are efficient , as most of them are , are as much in need of additional incentives at the present time as people lower down the scale .
