# text = I do not know from personal knowledge that that figure is accurate , but I should imagine there is a vast difference between agricultural values in Middlesex or anywhere else in the country and the £ 600 an acre which the Government are willing to pay , although , as I have said , I appreciate that the £ 600 would cover much more than the bare agricultural value .
